flowchart LR
 PO[PO] --> ASN[Supplier ASN]
 ASN --> R[Roll QR]
 R --> W[Weigh evidence]
 W --> QC[Quarantine QC]
 QC --> PR[ERP Purchase Receipt]
 PR --> BIN[Warehouse Bin]
 BIN --> CUT[Cut Ticket]
 CUT --> Bundle[Bundle QR]
 CUT --> Remnant[Remnant Roll ID]
 Bundle --> Op[Sewing operations]
 Op --> FG[FG batch + QC]
 FG --> CTN[Carton QR]
 CTN --> SHIP[Shipment]
 SHIP --> CH[Marketplace acceptance]
